{
  "id": "fair2grow",
  "name": "DigiLab TK: FAIR2Grow",
  "description": "Wageningen University & Research, TNO and NLR from the FAIR2Grow use case, sharing greenhouse experiment data. WUR publishes the logical model of its Greenhouse Data Platform export in Semantic Treehouse (bottom-up), and its record names that model in dct:conformsTo. The Vocabulary Hub holds a Semantic Treehouse export with the WUR model, a model derived from SAREF4AGRI and SOSA, and the alignments between them. Records follow DCAT-AP 3.0.1. The WUR export and the 4TU publication are real; the TNO dataset is illustrative. Licence of the export assumed from the 4TU publication (CC BY 4.0), to be confirmed by WUR. Access policies are not modelled.",
